title: Data Flow Diagram (DFD) - Smart Funeral Claims Platform
---

flowchart TD
  User[User] -->|Submits Claim| ClaimsForm[Claim Form]
  ClaimsForm -->|Sends Data| Backend[Backend Server]
  Backend -->|Stores| Firestore[(Firestore DB)]
  Backend -->|Stores| Storage[(Firebase Storage)]
